# Bubblewrap's generated Android project. Regenerate it any time with `bubblewrap update`
# (it is derived entirely from twa-manifest.json) — only the manifest and the shipped
# square-root-calendar.apk are worth versioning. This repo also deploys to Vercel, so
# keeping the Gradle tree out of git keeps it out of the deployment too.
